  {"heading":"Heat tiles / Gráfico -Blocos de calor","segment_index":"S10.P1","kind":"missing","en_span":"chapters/interactive_plots.qmd:196-196","tr_span":"chapters/interactive_plots.pt.qmd:198-198","proposition":"The English states that the reader can learn how to build the heat-tile plot shown below by reading the [Heat plots](heatmaps.qmd) chapter; the Portuguese contains no such cross-reference.","reader_consequence":"A Portuguese reader who wants to reproduce the heat tile is told the code will not be described in depth, but is never pointed to the chapter that does explain it, so they have no route to the explanation.","confidence":"high"},
